{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中亞國家哈薩克一個當地服裝及紡織品牌落戶香港。</p><p></p><p>品牌的特色，是以哈薩克傳統圖案及原創印花，設計時尚服飾及家居紡織品，以香港作為首個拓展海外業務的試點，期望透過香港作為亞洲貿易中心，測試本地及國際旅客反應，再拓展海外市場。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INVEST-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026acvKHMhKMM1795082639.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>投資推廣署指，特首年中率團訪問中亞，促成多份合作協議，今次是繼農業、資源公司進駐後，再有消費品類型公司來港，以本港作為試驗場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.007255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.138128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.155482+00:00","content_hash":"a32e9e6373a0e12244df846330d579c16c61cb53b5e7746de1573682c0a9387f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.007255+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}